# A Street that meets another at 31° is laid with snapping on (#154).
#
# godot --path src/Borough.Godot -- --empty --citizens 1000 --drive scripts/ui/shallow-join.drive
#
# The angle guide must not pull the second Street onto the 30° crossing minimum, where the end's
# rounding to a Tile can leave it just under and the core refuses it. The second Street waits a
# Tick so the guide measures from the first one.

256 hold street
256 click 300 300
256 click 428 300

258 click 300 300
258 click 410 366

260 pause
260 readout artifacts/shallow-join/laid.txt
260 draw artifacts/shallow-join/laid.tsv
260 quit
